cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use llmcomposer in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: llmcomposer
abstract: >-
  An instrument for probing the cross-modal musical understanding of
  language models: an LLM copilot composes and revises music in ABC
  notation under a deliberately strict validator, and every turn — including
  every validator rejection and its typed error code — is recorded.
authors:
  - family-names: Nodeland
    given-names: Alex
    email: alex@ournature.studio
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexnodeland/llmcomposer"
url: "https://alexnodeland.github.io/llmcomposer/"
keywords:
  - music
  - symbolic-music-generation
  - abc-notation
  - large-language-models
  - llm-evaluation
